    "runtime": 30,
    "summary": "<p>Royal family enjoys skiing until something goes wrong and everyone but Orko end up frozen by the Ice Lord. Orko pretends to be He-Man and confronts Ice Lord. Upon winning he finds out that Skeletor has his daughter. Ice Lord agrees to release the royal family if He-Man rescues his daughter. Orko agrees, but requests at least one of the royal family to be released as a token of good will. Prince Adam plays along and heads to Snake Mountain with Orko.</p>"
